  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/2f4827d6c367e0ea8420c544b42741e2ed11d5854492c3a23549c81abe5d4421.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tGiả sử đặt trạm y tế cách làng B tại vị trí A cách B là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> km (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> km, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> km.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>292</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> km.<br>Thời gian đi từ D đến A là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>292</mn></mrow></msqrt><mn>75</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.<br>Thời gian đi từ B đến A là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>60</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.<br>Thời gian cứu thương cho hai địa điểm là như nhau nên\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>292</mn></mrow></msqrt><mn>75</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>292</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>.</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mspace width=\"1.0em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div> \n\t\tBình phương hai vế của (1), ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>292</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>512</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4672</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(thỏa mãn (1))</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>584</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(loại)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVới <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>292</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> km.<br>Vậy nên đặt trạm y tế cách đảo D <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math> km để thời gian cứu thương cho hai địa điểm là như nhau.",
